<size:22><b>Business Decisions</b></size>
<color:gray>Key business rules, policies, and decisions</color>
A closed assessment is immutable; a correction creates a new assessment
No plan without an active diagnosis
The practitioner chooses equation, reference weight, activity factor and deficit
Overriding a proposal requires a reason
Every adjustment requires a reason; previous versions are superseded, never deleted
Diagnosis and calculation basis never leave the context
A review item never modifies the plan automatically
}
